131 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 657 0 R>>/DA(/Helv  0 Tf 0 g)/DR<</Encoding<</PDFDocEncoding 21 0 R>>/Font<</Helv 20 0 R>>>>/F 4/FT/Tx/P 218 0 R/Q 1/Rect[498.96 129.84 669.12 146.64]/T(Market impactedRow3)/TU(Market impacted_Row_3)>>
